+# Billing disputes
+
+The configured refund window is 30 days.
+
+For refund or invoice disputes, use only the billing or account evidence available for the case. No invoice amounts, line items, dates, payment statuses, adjustments, or invoice-specific dispute policy are established here. State what is missing and escalate when the available evidence cannot resolve the question; do not infer or invent billing details.

